    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amazd</strong> is a 2D fast-paced, pixel-art <strong>roguelike dungeon crawler</strong> where every second counts! Battle through <strong>procedurally generated mazes</strong>, slay <strong>monsters and powerful bosses</strong>, and collect loot to power up and increase your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Tutorial</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a short tutorial that can be accessed from the main menu, which teaches players the ropes of Amazd. You will learn how to fight, move through mazes and beat the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Main Game - 8 Levels</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a series of 8 levels in Amazd, each one contains a procedurally generated maze, with the 8th level being a boss fight! The mazes get increasingly more difficult as you progress. <strong>Each maze contains:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Coins to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Monster to slay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Powerups and Potions to use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A portal to the next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score goes down every second! so slay monsters and collect coins to increase your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Don't Die!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You only have 7 hearts, so careful not to die in combat, otherwise game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You have a stamina bar, so careful when sprinting so save stamina!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The aim is to beat all 8 levels as fast as possible, and get a highest score!</strong>\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Amazd</strong> is a 2D fast-paced, pixel-art <strong>roguelike dungeon crawler</strong> where every second counts! Battle through <strong>procedurally generated mazes</strong>, slay <strong>monsters and powerful bosses</strong>, and collect loot to power up and increase your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Tutorial</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a short tutorial that can be accessed from the main menu, which teaches players the ropes of Amazd. You will learn how to fight, move through mazes and beat the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Main Game - 8 Levels</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a series of 8 levels in Amazd, each one contains a procedurally generated maze, with the 8th level being a boss fight! The mazes get increasingly more difficult as you progress. <strong>Each maze contains:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Coins to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Monster to slay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Powerups and Potions to use</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-A portal to the next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your score goes down every second! so slay monsters and collect coins to increase your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Don't Die!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You only have 7 hearts, so careful not to die in combat, otherwise game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-You have a stamina bar, so careful when sprinting so save stamina!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The aim is to beat all 8 levels as fast as possible, and get a highest score!</strong>\u00a0</p>",
